1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Bxc6 dxc6 7. Qe1 Nd7 8.
d4 exd4 9. Nxd4 O-O 10. Nc3 Ne5 11. Be3 Ng4 12. Rd1 Bd6 13. f4 Nxe3 14. Qxe3
Bc5 15. Kh1 Bg4 16. Rd3 Qe7 17. Qg3 f5 18. Re1 Rae8 19. h3 Bh5 20. e5 Bxd4 21.
Rxd4 Bf7 22. Red1 Be6 23. Nb1 $5 h6 {He offered a draw, which I should have
accepted.} 24. Nd2 ({I'd originally planned} 24. Qa3 {but after} Qxa3 25. Nxa3
g5 26. g3 gxf4 27. gxf4 Kf7 {Black is fine.}) 24... Kf7 25. Nf3 Rg8 26. h4 g6
27. Qh3 Rg7 28. h5 ({The start of a totally wrong plan. Much better is} 28.
R4d2 Kg8 29. a3 Bd5 $14) 28... g5 29. fxg5 $2 hxg5 30. h6 Rg6 31. Qh5 $2 Rh8
32. Rd7 Bxd7 33. e6+ Qxe6 34. Nxg5+ Kf6 {Source: Roger Emerson} 0-1

